//@ filecheck: --match-full-lines
// A constant right operand stays a condition, since lowering still branches before it, but both
// counts of its branch region are zero, as Clang marks a folded condition, so consumers leave it
// out of branch and MC/DC coverage. The code region of `true`, then its branch region,
// `[6, 0, 104, 4, 0, 0, 2, -1, -1]`.
// CHECK: 104,
// CHECK: 104,
// CHECK-NEXT: 4,
// CHECK-NEXT: 0,
// CHECK-NEXT: 0,
// CHECK-NEXT: 2,
// CHECK-NEXT: -1,
// CHECK-NEXT: -1
